.git
# `**`-prefixed because a bare `node_modules` anchors to the context root,
# leaving web/app/node_modules (dangling pnpm symlinks, Vite cache) to upload
# and overwrite the builder's fresh install, breaking `build: .`.
**/node_modules
.vscode
.env
.DS_Store
*.sketch
config.yaml
# Tests, repo metadata and docs never reach the runtime image; excluding them
# shrinks the context uploaded to the daemon.
tests/
# Test configs live at the repo root, so `tests/` doesn't cover them.
tsconfig.test.json
vitest.config.ts
.github/
docs/
*.markdown
CHANGELOG.md
RELEASE_NOTES.markdown
# Keeps a stale local build out of the context. The image still gets a fresh
# bundle: `COPY --from=builder` bypasses .dockerignore by design.
dist/
data/
secrets/
web/app/dist
